Spec: SpecDD Path Reference Provider

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Provide path and backticked code PSI references for SpecDD PSI elements.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceProvider.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceProvider.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceExtractor.kt
  ./SpecDDCodeReferenceExtractor.kt
  ./SpecDDPathReference.kt
  ./SpecDDSymbolReference.kt
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDFileType.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDPathReferenceProviderBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Return references only for SpecDD files.
  Extract candidates from the containing file text.
  Return references whose ranges are relative to the current PSI element.
  Skip candidates outside the current PSI element range.
  Provide path references for backticked explicit path candidates.
  Keep backticked explicit path references warning-free when unresolved.
  Provide symbol references for backticked non-path code candidates.
  Keep backticked reference ranges on the inner content, not the backtick delimiters.
  Build path resolution contexts from the IntelliJ project root, not from module or content roots.
  Support file-level reference lookup for Go to Declaration on minimal SpecDD PSI files.

Must not:
  Report diagnostics.
  Define path extraction rules independently from the extractor.
  Link unbackticked prose as symbol references.
